# Purpose: geometry-only copy of mini_raw8_dual/pins.fdc (2026-10-07).
# All board locations and electrical standards are unchanged. Run13 leaves
# TXD3 setup negative with positive hold margin; use 16 mA on all TX ports.
# PAD-delay estimates motivate this candidate but never replace routed STA.
# Official PG2L100H LVCMOS33 permits only 4/8/12/16 mA, not 20/24 mA.
# This adjusts physical PAD delay, not PHY budgets/phase. Fresh min/max STA
# must pass; the shared published dual-output constraints are not edited.
# Purpose: reviewed MINI J10 + proven GE/UART pin sets; no duplicate pads.
# Purpose: leave the native delay block bypassed. OUT_DELAY=0 enables the block
# and is NOT the same as bypass (confirmed in the retained failed timing run).
